'''Ubdurians''' were a [[species]] of [[Sentience|sentient]] [[humanoid]]s<ref name="TFAVD" /> native to [[Nag Ubdur]]<ref name="Life Debt" /> and [[Ubduria]].<ref name="Aliens of the Galaxy" /> Their bald heads featured dark [[eye]]s seated deep in their sockets, but no visible [[nose]].<ref name="TFAVD" />

In ancient [[time]]s, the [[Mandalorian]]s undertook a [[Mandalorian crusades|crusade]] into [[the galaxy]]'s [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]] [[star system]]s and [[Devastation of Ubduria|devastated]] the [[planet]] [[Ubduria]] out of contempt for the native Ubdurians, who they viewed as dishonorable cowards.<ref name="Aliens of the Galaxy" />

[[Prashee]] and [[Cratinus]], two Ubdurian brothers, were present in the [[Takodana Castle|castle]] of [[Maz Kanata]] when the [[First Order]] [[Battle of Takodana|assaulted]] [[Takodana]].<ref name="TFAVD" />

==Behind the scenes==
There is a discrepancy regarding the species' planet of origin. According to ''[[Star Wars: Aliens of the Galaxy]]'', the Ubdurians originated on Ubduria, in the galaxy's Inner Rim, and were among the first [[spacefaring]] species.<ref name="Aliens of the Galaxy" /> However, in ''[[Aftermath: Life Debt]]'', the planet Nag Ubdur, in the Outer Rim Territories, is described as "home to the native Ubdurians."<ref name="Life Debt" /> ''[[Star Wars: Alien Archive]]'' later established both planets to be Ubdurian homeworlds.<ref name="Alien Archive">''[[Star Wars: Alien Archive]]''</ref>

